GeoNames shipping dataset
=========================

The JSON files in this directory are derived from the GeoNames geographical
database:

  https://www.geonames.org/
  https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/

Source data is copyright GeoNames contributors and is licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You are free to share and adapt the data for any purpose, provided you give
appropriate credit, provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes
were made. No additional restrictions may be applied.

Attribution notice:
  Contains data from GeoNames, licensed under CC BY 4.0.

Modifications made for this project:
  - Filtered to populated places (feature class P) in officially assigned
    ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 countries with population greater than zero.
  - Reduced to GeoNames ID, city name, admin-1 region name, latitude,
    longitude, and population.
  - Resolved country and region display names from GeoNames reference files.
  - Serialized as JSON and sorted deterministically.

No coordinates, city names, or population values were altered.
See README.md for the source dump date, filter criteria, coverage exceptions,
and rebuild command.
